      "rev_n_1_903158_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_903158_0",
        "node_id": "n_1_903158",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the remainder of a divided by b. If the remainder is 0, the answer is 0. Otherwise, the answer is b minus the remainder.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506987.542203
      },
      "rev_n_2_edcfea_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_edcfea_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_edcfea",
        "thought_text": "Use the modulo operator to find the distance to the next multiple of b directly as (b - (a % b)) % b, handling the zero case implicitly.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506987.5422187
      },
      "rev_n_3_635557_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_635557_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_635557",
        "thought_text": "Iterate incrementing a by 1 until a % b == 0, counting steps, though this is inefficient for large numbers and unnecessary given the O(1) math solution exists.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506987.542227
      },
      "rev_n_4_2fee4c_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_2fee4c_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_2fee4c",
        "thought_text": "Calculate remainder r = a % b; if r == 0 answer is 0, else answer is b - r.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "807196950274707498",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794507001.864881
      },
      "rev_n_5_7f53e8_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_7f53e8_0",
        "node_id": "n_5_7f53e8",
        "thought_text": "Use integer division to find the next multiple: target = ((a // b) + 1) * b, then answer is target - a.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "807196950274707498",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794507001.8648965
      },
      "rev_n_6_f7effb_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_f7effb_0",
        "node_id": "n_6_f7effb",
        "thought_text": "Handle the edge case where a is already divisible by b separately, then compute the difference to the next multiple.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "807196950274707498",
